# The knowledge of the configuration cost_comparison
# (com.yang_bo.gezi.programfamilies.Configurations), the Scott tuple of its two fields,
# each a term of this file and not a choice the host assembles from paths:
# knowledge  the native route's library, the knowledge files the
#            configuration's library is compiled from
# enabled    the knowledge of the type-checking round of the native route's
#            schedule, whose lemmas its runs enable
# The file is read by projection off the tree whose visible subtree is
# Gezi's directory (StandardLibrary.entryTerm).
# FIXME: this configuration enables native typing (native_types, https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/2042
# native_arithmetic and their unions) with no backend, which the rule of
# CONTRIBUTING.md, "Efficiency by design, with native structures", rules out: native types
# are enabled only where the configured backend supports them, and native
# typing and its backend as one preset of the module system. It is the
# configuration ported from before that rule; it is to enable that preset
# once it is written.
# FIXME: the imports project "corpora" off the variable gezi, the name https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/1924
# of the project root's own directory; they break if that directory is renamed.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λmixin. mixin mixin)
λ omega
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "native_types")
λ native_types
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "native_arithmetic")
λ native_arithmetic
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions")
λ hindley_milner_unions
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "native_arithmetic_unions")
λ native_arithmetic_unions
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "occurrence_erasure")
λ occurrence_erasure
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "closure_application")
λ closure_application
. export
λ s
. s
  ( closure_application
  + occurrence_erasure
  + native_arithmetic_unions
  + hindley_milner_unions
  + native_arithmetic
  + native_types
  )
  (native_arithmetic_unions + hindley_milner_unions)
